| Sep 28–Oct 4 | 46 | 2 | [Source line 37310](../logs/codex/chats/01a0d281-ce48-72a3-8f42-b3a849471fd1/conversation.md#source-line-37310) |
| Oct 5–11 | 5,868 | 5 | [Source line 38554](../logs/codex/chats/01a0d281-ce48-72a3-8f42-b3a849471fd1/conversation.md#source-line-38554) |
